Add UndefinedBehaviorSanitizer (UBSan) build target.

CMake build configuration that enables UBSan for detecting undefined behavior.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] cmake -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=UBSan (or combined with ASan) enables UBSan
- [ ] -fsanitize=undefined added to compile and link flags
- [ ] Signed integer overflow, null pointer deref, alignment detected
- [ ] All test targets build and run with UBSan
- [ ] UBSan findings fixed or suppressed with justification

## Test Plan
- [ ] Build with UBSan, run all tests, verify clean report
- [ ] Verify audio path has no undefined behavior
- [ ] Fix any UBSan findings
